WEBVTT

00:00:04.676 --> 00:00:11.416
MARMALADE BOY

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:14.442
Dakedo ki ni naru

00:00:14.586 --> 00:00:16.554
Kinou yori mo zutto...

00:00:17.956 --> 00:00:21.414
Togireta yume. ..

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:24.825
Futari no tsuzukiga shiritai!

00:00:31.169 --> 00:00:36.402
Ah, kami—sama...
jikan o... tomete yo

00:00:36.942 --> 00:00:43.006
Kyou kasho... seifuku...
mada kami, kawakana... i

00:00:44.349 --> 00:00:49.810
Ah, tasukete...
ribbon ga kimaranai...

00:00:50.455 --> 00:00:56.587
Aitsu no yume mita sei... yo

00:00:57.529 --> 00:01:01.295
Koge—kake no toast kajitara...

00:01:04.036 --> 00:01:08.837
Naze ka fui ni...
mune ga tokimeita...

00:01:10.709 --> 00:01:15.578
Amakute nigai. .. marmalade

00:01:15.714 --> 00:01:18.148
Dakara ki ni naru...

00:01:18.684 --> 00:01:20.709
Konna kimochi wa naze?

00:01:22.187 --> 00:01:23.950
Ima ichiban...

00:01:25.424 --> 00:01:28.951
Aitsu no egao wo mitai!

00:02:33.525 --> 00:02:41.455
RIVAL —
"I LOVE YUU!"

00:11:27.992 --> 00:11:30.552
MARMALADE BOY

00:11:36.734 --> 00:11:39.362
MARMALADE BOY

00:20:31.635 --> 00:20:34.297
HOW DISAPPOINTING

00:22:11.268 --> 00:22:12.360
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:34.892 --> 00:22:37.861
SUZU AND KEI — "THOSE TWO
MAKE ME NERVOUS... "

00:22:53.611 --> 00:22:59.777
Seiza—tachiga kirameite. ..
hizuke o kaeru

00:23:01.352 --> 00:23:07.655
Yosoyuki—gao ga ko cha ni...
sotto tokeru no

00:23:08.025 --> 00:23:16.160
Tada no watashi ni...
modoru shunkan

00:23:16.867 --> 00:23:22.032
Mada mada ima
wa nemuresou ni nai...

00:23:23.440 --> 00:23:26.500
Totsuzen—sugiru. ..

00:23:27.278 --> 00:23:31.146
Atarashii tokimeki ni

00:23:36.353 --> 00:23:38.787
Okashi—na kimochi yo

00:23:38.923 --> 00:23:46.557
Tatta hitori no...
dareka ni kawatteyuku...

00:23:47.131 --> 00:23:54.162
Sonna yokan. ..
dakishimeteitai. ..

00:23:54.738 --> 00:23:58.299
Nemuru made...
